ogressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1677413892/3vfk_62dc6e1e-61fe-4a80-bd7a-a7795600c0ec.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":23,"rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:34.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:34.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":3541535,"path":"https://res-1.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1677413944/3vfk_f9c49d05-3fff-4dcf-bb09-d7bafd5297d6.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:34.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:34.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":4859595,"review":"Already my third time to stay at one of Xuru’s units in Gouna. Simply they are perfect in all aspects and I highly recommend it for anyone to stay at their units.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:27.000000Z"},{"id":5027142,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z"},{"id":5249188,"review":"😍😍","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5264770,"review":"Cozy apartment in El Gouna, excellent host","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5273256,"review":"Мне все понравилось, для кайтера удобное расположение.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5280925,"review":"Xuru is very professional host, it is the first time but definitely won’t be the last :)","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5308959,"review":"The overall experience was okay","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5316455,"review":"The place itself is nice and cozy, \nInternet is not working even after I complained nothing happened!\nI had to wait 1:30 min to get inside \nIt’s clean and the location is good","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5321389,"review":"great place","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5333181,"review":"cyan is very quiet and beautiful \npool is walking distance\napartment was fully furnished and had everything we needed\nxuru stays were very responsive and always found alternatives \nthey called muliple times to check on us and make sure we are comfortable during our stay\ndefinitely will be coming back 🥰","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5371987,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5372517,"review":"Good hospitality and communication.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5377251,"review":"اقامه رائعه","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5400003,"review":"They informed me that check-in would be at 5 PM, and they would send the lockbox code by that time. However, I was left waiting until 10 PM to receive it. I had only booked for one day, and they sent someone to check me out at 11 AM. When I raised the issue with them, they were dismissive and blamed the delay on my same-day booking, even though they never mentioned that this could be a potential issue when booking on the same day.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5402452,"review":"Was our first time and the experience was great","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5408023,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5419234,"review":"Positive:\nWe loved quiet location and beautiful view from balcony\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5450238,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5454347,"review":"Positive:\nClean and neat\n\nNegative:\nLocation","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5459419,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5479025,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5482319,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5502991,"review":"The apartment is quite new and in good condition with all kitchen appliances one would need. It has a lovely open view over the golf course and still centrally located between the downtown, marina (30 mins walk) and the kitesurfing centers. On top of that the property management/host are friendly and very responsive. Would definitely stay there again!","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5538177,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5540878,"review":"Positive:\nLa vue, la propriété, les personnels très respectueux\n\nNegative:\nRien","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:00.000000Z"},{"id":5552243,"review":"Great stay, responsive host. Will definitely be back!","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5559700,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5564449,"review":"Extremely good place \nfriendly helpful host","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5565277,"review":"Positive:\nAll we liked\n\nNegative:\nAll was perfect","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5587315,"review":"Positive:\npretty much everything.  the cleanliness.\n\nNegative:\nthe commuting to marina or sandbox was very challenging","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5597496,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5606030,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5628366,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5715284,"review":"Positive:\nВсе хорошо, каждый день ребята интересовались все ли хорошо.\n\nNegative:\nХочется швабру в номере или метелку, чтобы можно было самой помыть полы или песок хотя бы подмести. И хотя бы одну бутылку воды при заселении в холодильнике. Потому что если заселяться ночью и с собой нет воды то немного тяжело дотерпеть до утра чтобы в магазин съездить.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5727608,"review":"The place was really cozy and homelike, close to everything. Not my first time staying with Xuru Stays and can confirm they’re the best in Airbnb, always there to support promptly and help with whatever’s needed. Will stay with them again 👍🏼","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5730253,"review":"Positive:\nThe apartment is exceptional for couples or even family , apartment size is good enough , everything is clean and well organized and nothing is unavailable, check in was so easy and everything was prepared before my arrival , the location is so good it is close to abutigmarina and fanadir marina and mangroovy. Finally special thanks to the staff there they are so friendly and helpful and they respond quickly to any inquiry and thanks for allowing me to check out lately.\n\nNegative:\nNothing I did not like , highly recommended","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5736823,"review":"Ich hatte einen wundervollen Aufenthalt bei Xuru Stays! Die Wohnung war absolut makellos sauber, die Lage einfach perfekt und die Kommunikation jederzeit schnell, freundlich und unkompliziert. Ich habe mich vom ersten Moment an super wohl und gut aufgehoben gefühlt. Man merkt, dass hier mit viel Liebe zum Detail gearbeitet wird und ich kann es wirklich von Herzen weiterempfehlen und komme sehr gerne wieder!","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5766857,"review":"👌","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5799926,"review":"Positive:\nFajny apartament .. 2 łazienki co było super na plus 💪 dobra lokalizacja cisza i spokój .. gospodarze bardzo pomocni\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5849534,"review":"Miejsce ok standard egipski czystości, wyraźne braki w wyposażeniu kuchni konieczne doposażenie oraz naprawa mebli kuchennych. Generalnie polecam","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5940206,"review":"Positive:\nPogled na golf igralište, opskrbljenost kućanskih aparata, krevet, tuš kada prostrana.\n\nNegative:\nVrata od perilice suđa se ne mogu otvoriti zbog kvaka na ladicama. Nije bilo kuhinjske krpe, spužve, nije bilo posude za salatu ili povrće...Više aparata spojeni na produžni kabel u kuhinji, mali mravi .","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6070287,"review":"Ich bin sehr zufrieden und kann nur Lob für die Gute Kommunikation und Sauberkeit der Unterkunft aussprechen.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6095010,"review":"Very responsive and friendly host. Cleanness could have been better, but they have acted proactive and were keen to resolve the issue. Unfortunately, it took us three attempts to archive an acceptable level of cleanness in the bathroom. The mattress in the bedroom was very hard but other than these two aspects, we had a very nice stay and will certainly come back to El Gouna.","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6105332,"review":"Perfect 👌🏽","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6158492,"review":"Thanks a million for your hospitality, everything went smoothly actually. The studio was absolutely neat and fully furnished. The location is mesmerizing, just a few minutes away from the downtown. Would love to return back again indeed❤️","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6158744,"review":"Positive:\nExceptional one\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6158745,"review":"Positive:\nEverything is exceptional ,location , cleanliness , modern furniture , area , easy check in and check out , room service ,  room facilities there is everything you need during your stay , and finally the room view is so nice , highly recommended for solo or couples or even family with 1 or two kids\n\nNegative:\nNo sea access for free in Cyan Gouna but there is a swimming pool and there are many beaches you can access with entrance fees","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6165760,"review":"Positive:\nEverything was perfect . The hosts were so helpful.\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":180704,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[{"id":97,"key":"heating","en_title":"Heating","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":180704,"amenity_id":97}},{"id":76,"key":"freezer","en_title":"Freezer","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":180704,"amenity_id":76}},{"id":75,"key":"fridge","en_title":"Fridge","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":180704,"amenity_id":75}},{"id":79,"key":"full_equipped_kitchen","en_title":"Full Equipped Kitchen","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":180704,"amenity_id":79}},{"id":12,"key":"bottled_water","en_title":"Bottle